pan ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你悄然出现，为这扇心门开锁</span></p><p begin="00:45.000" end="00:50.078" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:45.000" end="00:45.262">Like</span> <span begin="00:45.262" end="00:46.436">threads,</span> <span begin="00:46.816" end="00:47.284">pe</span><span begin="00:47.284" end="00:47.778">tals</span> <span begin="00:48.157" end="00:48.978">un</span><span begin="00:48.978" end="00:50.078">fold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如丝线一般，花瓣舒展</span></p><p begin="00:51.286" end="00:57.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:51.286" end="00:51.778">A</span> <span begin="00:51.778" end="00:52.257">red</span> <span begin="00:52.257" end="00:52.675">ka</span><span begin="00:52.675" end="00:53.250">wa</span><span begin="00:53.628" end="00:54.046">ra-</span><span begin="00:54.046" end="00:54.488">na</span><span begin="00:54.488" end="00:55.018">de</span><span begin="00:55.720" end="00:56.289">shi</span><span begin="00:56.289" end="00:57.308">ko</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一朵鲜红的河原抚子花</span></p><p begin="00:59.053" end="01:13.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:59.053" end="00:59.456">You</span> <span begin="00:59.456" end="00:59.999">have</span> <span begin="00:59.999" end="01:01.752">shown</span> <span begin="01:01.752" end="01:02.878">me</span> <span begin="01:03.191" end="01:03.647">that</span> <span begin="01:03.647" end="01:04.866">I</span> <span begin="01:04.866" end="01:05.277">am</span> <span begin="01:05.277" end="01:06.456">still</span> <span begin="01:06.810" end="01:07.020">ca</span><span begin="01:07.020" end="01:07.276">pa</span><span begin="01:07.276" end="01:08.614">ble</span> <span begin="01:08.614" end="01:09.045">of</span> <span begin="01:09.045" end="01:09.961">car</span><span begin="01:09.961" end="01:10.378">ing</span> <span begin="01:10.619" end="01:10.830">for</span> <span begin="01:10.830" end="01:11.175">some</span><span begin="01:11.812" end="01:12.071">one</span> <span begin="01:12.667" end="01:13.348">else</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你使我发现，原来我还存有能力关爱他人</span></p><p begin="01:14.097" end="01:25.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:14.097" end="01:14.503">That</span> <span begin="01:14.503" end="01:15.889">I</span> <span begin="01:15.889" end="01:16.397">still</span> <span begin="01:16.397" end="01:17.348">bare</span> <span begin="01:17.708" end="01:18.035">the</span> <span begin="01:18.035" end="01:18.968">same</span> <span begin="01:18.968" end="01:19.402">in</span><span begin="01:19.402" end="01:19.859">no</span><span begin="01:19.859" end="01:21.028">cence</span> <span begin="01:21.533" end="01:21.712">in</span><span begin="01:21.712" end="01:25.930">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">原来在我的内心深处还留有一份纯真</span></p><p begin="01:26.793" end="01:29.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:26.793" end="01:27.100">Cau</span><span begin="01:27.100" end="01:27.280">se</span> <span begin="01:27.280" end="01:27.712">now</span> <span begin="01:27.712" end="01:27.947">I</span> <span begin="01:27.947" end="01:28.636">know</span> <span begin="01:28.636" end="01:29.128">that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为此刻我明白</span></p><p begin="01:29.128" end="01:32.077" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:29.128" end="01:29.556">Pain</span> <span begin="01:29.556" end="01:29.734">can</span><span begin="01:29.734" end="01:30.444">not</span> <span begin="01:30.444" end="01:30.799">de</span><span begin="01:30.799" end="01:31.366">fine</span> <span begin="01:31.366" end="01:31.569">the</span> <span begin="01:31.569" end="01:32.077">past</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">疼痛无从定义过去</span></p><p begin="01:32.296" end="01:36.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:32.296" end="01:32.498">We</span> <span begin="01:32.498" end="01:32.736">are</span> <span begin="01:32.736" end="01:33.154">built</span> <span begin="01:33.154" end="01:33.304">to</span> <span begin="01:33.304" end="01:34.550">over</span><span begin="01:34.550" end="01:35.002">come</span> <span begin="01:35.002" end="01:35.238">end</span><span begin="01:35.238" end="01:35.899">less</span> <span begin="01:35.899" end="01:36.368">mis</span><span begin="01:36.368" end="01:36.826">haps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们生来就被赐予能够跨越无数波折的力量</span></p><p begin="01:37.040" end="01:41.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:37.040" end="01:37.285">You</span> <span begin="01:37.285" end="01:37.537">know,</span> <span begin="01:37.537" end="01:37.901">it</span> <span begin="01:37.901" end="01:38.179">is</span> <span begin="01:38.179" end="01:38.965">not</span> <span begin="01:38.965" end="01:40.008">so</span> <span begin="01:40.008" end="01:41.128">bad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">其实没有那么苦</span></p><p begin="01:41.368" end="01:43.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:41.368" end="01:41.786">When</span> <span begin="01:41.786" end="01:42.238">you</span> <span begin="01:42.238" end="01:42.506">are</span> <span begin="01:42.506" end="01:43.186">with</span> <span begin="01:43.186" end="01:43.539">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为有你和我相伴</span></p><p begin="01:43.599" end="01:46.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:43.599" end="01:44.173">Cher</span><span begin="01:44.173" end="01:44.567">ish</span> <span begin="01:44.567" end="01:44.986">as</span> <span begin="01:44.986" end="01:45.465">long</span> <span begin="01:45.465" end="01:45.888">as</span> <span begin="01:45.888" end="01:46.107">we</span> <span begin="01:46.107" end="01:46.579">last</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在我们的有生之年，珍惜这一切</span></p><p begin="01:46.811" end="01:51.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:46.811" end="01:47.136">Cau</span><span begin="01:47.136" end="01:47.266">se</span> <span begin="01:47.266" end="01:47.737">S</span> <span begin="01:47.737" end="01:47.918">is</span> <span begin="01:47.918" end="01:48.623">not</span> <span begin="01:48.623" end="01:48.788">for</span> <span begin="01:48.788" end="01:49.096">sa</span><span begin="01:49.096" end="01:49.979">yo</span><span begin="01:49.979" end="01:50.865">na</span><span begin="01:50.865" end="01:51.857">ra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为“再”并不是“再见”的“再”</span></p><p begin="01:52.285" end="01:56.493" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:52.285" end="01:52.682">Let</span> <span begin="01:52.682" end="01:53.100">mem</span><span begin="01:53.100" end="01:53.387">o</span><span begin="01:53.387" end="01:54.107">ries</span> <span begin="01:54.107" end="01:54.568">play</span> <span begin="01:54.568" end="01:56.493">back</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们重播回忆</span></p><p begin="02:23.178" end="02:29.247" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:23.178" end="02:23.600">I</span> <span begin="02:23.600" end="02:24.187">knew</span> <span begin="02:24.987" end="02:25.452">I</span> <span begin="02:25.452" end="02:26.403">must</span> <span begin="02:26.403" end="02:27.267">step</span> <span begin="02:27.267" end="02:29.247">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我确信我必须挺身努力</span></p><p begin="02:29.983" end="02:36.573" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:29.983" end="02:30.437">You</span> <span begin="02:30.437" end="02:30.829">de</span><span begin="02:30.829" end="02:32.477">serve</span> <span begin="02:32.477" end="02:32.678">the</span> <span begin="02:32.678" end="02:33.208">world</span> <span begin="02:33.608" end="02:34.547">and</span> <span begin="02:34.547" end="02:36.573">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你值得拥有整个世界，甚至更多</span></p><p begin="02:37.710" end="02:43.628" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:37.710" end="02:38.022">The</span> <span begin="02:38.022" end="02:38.825">tru</span><span begin="02:38.825" end="02:39.085">th</span> <span begin="02:39.594" end="02:39.966">is</span> <span begin="02:39.966" end="02:40.559">that</span> <span begin="02:40.559" end="02:40.903">you'd</span> <span begin="02:40.903" end="02:41.794">ra</span><span begin="02:41.794" end="02:43.628">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但其实你更希望</span></p><p begin="02:43.929" end="02:50.954" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:43.929" end="02:44.506">Spend</span> <span begin="02:44.506" end="02:45.452">our</span> <span begin="02:45.452" end="02:46.360">lim</span><span begin="02:46.360" end="02:46.765">it</span><span begin="02:46.765" end="02:47.278">ed</span> <span begin="02:47.278" end="02:47.727">time</span> <span begin="02:48.383" end="02:48.634">to</span><span begin="02:48.634" end="02:49.102">geth</span><span begin="02:49.102" end="02:50.954">er</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">希望我们可以一同度过这有限的时光</span></p><p begin="02:51.745" end="02:59.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:51.745" end="02:52.209">Pro</span><span begin="02:52.209" end="02:52.550">tec</span><span begin="02:52.550" end="02:54.100">tion</span> <span begin="02:54.100" end="02:54.556">a</span><span begin="02:54.556" end="02:55.455">lone</span> <span begin="02:55.914" end="02:56.365">is</span> <span begin="02:56.365" end="02:57.725">not</span> <span begin="02:57.725" end="02:58.178">en</span><span begin="02:58.178" end="02:58.648">ou</span><span begin="02:58.648" end="02:59.114">gh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仅靠保护远远不够</span></p><p begin="02:59.524" end="03:09.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:59.524" end="02:59.759">Pro</span><span begin="02:59.759" end="02:59.998">vid</span><span begin="02:59.998" end="03:01.364">ing</span> <span begin="03:01.364" end="03:01.826">can</span><span begin="03:01.826" end="03:02.580">not</span> <span begin="03:02.580" end="03:03.168">fill</span> <span begin="03:03.360" end="03:03.656">an</span> <span begin="03:03.656" end="03:04.485">emp</span><span begin="03:04.485" end="03:05.374">ty</span> <span begin="03:05.374" end="03:06.186">cup</span> <span begin="03:06.826" end="03:07.244">thirst</span><span begin="03:07.244" end="03:08.594">ing</span> <span begin="03:08.594" end="03:09.093">for</span> <span begin="03:09.093" end="03:09.994">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算付出，也无法填满你那渴求爱的空杯</span></p><p begin="03:10.443" end="03:18.713" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="03:10.443" end="03:10.846">I</span> <span begin="03:10.846" end="03:11.778">ques</span><span begin="03:11.778" end="03:12.244">tioned</span> <span begin="03:12.244" end="03:12.572">my</span><span begin="03:12.572" end="03:13.656">self</span> <span begin="03:14.307" end="03:14.565">a</span> <span begin="03:14.565" end="03:18.713">lot–</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我反复自问——</span></p><p begin="03:43.640" end="03:46.396" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="03:43.640" end="03:44.081">What</span> <span begin="03:44.081" end="03:44.339">do</span> <span begin="03:44.339" end="03:44.997">I</span> <span begin="03:44.997" end="03:45.166">know</span> <span begin="03:45.166" end="03:45.795">about</span> <span begin="03:45.795" end="03:46.396">love?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我懂什么是爱？</span></p><p begin="03:46.824" end="03:51.397" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="03:46.824" end="03:47.019">How</span> <span begin="03:47.019" end="03:47.220">can</span> <span begin="03:47.220" end="03:47.661">I</span> <span begin="03:47.661" end="03:47.942">re</span><span begin="03:47.942" end="03:48.647">cre</span><span begin="03:48.647" end="03:49.085">ate</span> <span begin="03:49.085" end="03:49.434">what</span> <span begin="03:49.434" end="03:49.749">I've</span> <span begin="03:49.749" end="03:50.395">nev</span><span begin="03:50.395" end="03:50.855">er</span> <span begin="03:50.855" end="03:51.397">had?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">明明从未体验过，又怎能把它重现？</span></p><p begin="03:51.810" end="03:57.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:51.810" end="03:52.086">All</span> <span begin="03:52.086" end="03:52.450">I</span> <span begin="03:52.450" end="03:52.717">know</span> <span begin="03:52.717" end="03:53.618">is</span> <span begin="03:53.618" end="03:54.344">that</span> <span begin="03:54.344" end="03:54.595">I</span> <span begin="03:54.595" end="03:55.477">must</span> <span begin="03:55.877" end="03:56.229">keep</span> <span begin="03:56.229" end="03:56.964">you</span> <span begin="03:56.964" end="03:57.538">thriv</span><span begin="03:57.538" end="03:57.986">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只知道，一定要让你茁壮成长</span></p><p begin="03:58.173" end="04:01.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="03:58.173" end="03:58.570">If</span> <span begin="03:58.570" end="03:58.853">nu</span><span begin="03:58.853" end="03:59.499">tri</span><span begin="03:59.499" end="03:59.742">ents</span> <span begin="03:59.742" end="04:00.052">are</span> <span begin="04:00.052" end="04:00.378">what</span> <span begin="04:00.378" end="04:00.752">you</span> <span begin="04:00.752" end="04:01.121">lack</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若你缺乏养分</span></p><p begin="04:01.389" end="04:09.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="04:01.389" end="04:01.580">I</span> <span begin="04:01.580" end="04:01.832">will</span> <span begin="04:01.832" end="04:02.266">wa</span><span begin="04:02.266" end="04:02.526">ter</span> <span begin="04:02.526" end="04:03.153">you</span> <span begin="04:03.240" end="04:03.653">with</span> <span begin="04:03.653" end="04:04.515">every</span> <span begin="04:04.515" end="04:05.244">drop</span> <span begin="04:05.244" end="04:05.412">of</span> <span begin="04:05.412" end="04:07.913">blood</span> <span begin="04:08.591" end="04:09.073">I</span> <span begin="04:09.073" end="04:09.924">have</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我愿把血液中的每一滴都浇灌给你</span></p><p begin="04:10.448" end="04:12.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="04:10.448" end="04:10.824">But</span> <span begin="04:10.824" end="04:11.344">now</span> <span begin="04:11.344" end="04:11.572">I</span> <span begin="04:11.572" end="04:12.204">know</span> <span begin="04:12.204" end="04:12.636">that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如今我终于明白</span></p><p begin="04:12.636" end="04:15.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="04:12.636" end="04:13.098">Sac</span><span begin="04:13.098" end="04:13.329">ri</span><span begin="04:13.329" end="04:13.982">fice</span> <span begin="04:13.982" end="04:14.223">is</span> <span begin="04:14.223" end="04:14.551">the</span> <span begin="04:14.551" end="04:14.934">ea</span><span begin="04:14.934" end="04:15.225">sy</span> <span begin="04:15.225" end="04:15.888">path</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">牺牲之路才是捷径</span></p><p begin="04:15.901" end="04:20.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="04:15.901" end="04:16.345">My</span> <span begin="04:16.345" end="04:16.734">ab</span><span begin="04:16.734" end="04:16.964">sence</span> <span begin="04:16.964" end="04:17.713">can</span><span begin="04:17.713" end="04:18.183">not</span> <span begin="04:18.183" end="04:18.852">ever</span> <span begin="04:18.852" end="04:19.419">chan</span><span begin="04:19.419" end="04:19.579">ge</span> <span begin="04:19.579" end="04:19.928">the</span> <span begin="04:19.928" end="04:20.484">fact</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的欠缺将无法颠覆这个事实：</span></p><p begin="04:20.661" end="04:27.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="04:20.661" end="04:20.873">I</span> <span begin="04:20.873" end="04:21.212">want</span><span begin="04:21.212" end="04:21.493">ed</span> <span begin="04:21.493" end="04:21.863">the</span> <span begin="04:21.863" end="04:23.627">very</span> <span begin="04:23.627" end="04:24.656">best</span> <span begin="04:24.947" end="04:25.396">for</span> <span begin="04:25.396" end="04:25.883">you,</span> <span begin="04:25.883" end="04:26.162">be</span><span begin="04:26.162" end="04:26.812">lieve</span> <span begin="04:26.812" end="04:27.014">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我其实只愿能给你提供最好的一生</span></p><p begin="04:27.014" end="04:30.223" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="04:27.014" end="04:27.250">Our</span> <span begin="04:27.250" end="04:27.671">threads</span> <span begin="04:27.671" end="04:27.970">in</span> <span begin="04:27.970" end="04:28.630">red</span> <span begin="04:28.630" end="04:28.852">can</span> <span begin="04:28.852" end="04:29.113">nev</span><span begin="04:29.113" end="04:29.553">er</span> <span begin="04:29.553" end="04:29.793">be</span> <span begin="04:29.793" end="04:30.223">cut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这条红线将永不会被斩断</span></p><p begin="04:30.451" end="04:35.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="04:30.451" end="04:30.903">And</span> <span begin="04:30.903" end="04:31.364">S</span> <span begin="04:31.364" end="04:31.543">is</span> <span begin="04:31.543" end="04:32.252">not</span> <span begin="04:32.252" end="04:32.424">for</span> <span begin="04:32.424" end="04:32.713">sa</span><span begin="04:32.713" end="04:33.621">yo</span><span begin="04:33.621" end="04:34.503">na</span><span begin="04:34.503" end="04:35.531">ra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“再”更不是“再见”的“再”</span></p><p begin="04:35.881" end="04:40.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="04:35.881" end="04:36.363">Will</span> <span begin="04:36.363" end="04:36.736">you</span> <span begin="04:36.736" end="04:37.044">for</span><span begin="04:37.044" end="04:37.519">give</span> <span begin="04:37.519" end="04:37.749">me</span> <span begin="04:37.749" end="04:38.193">at</span> <span begin="04:38.193" end="04:40.652">last?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你愿意最终原谅我吗？</span></p></div></body></tt>